/E (The OSCP+ exam is a practical, hands-on certification designed for individuals who want to demonstrate their proficiency in penetration testing. It tests your ability to perform real-world attacks and compromises against machines and systems in a controlled, exam environment. The exam consists of a series of penetration testing challenges, testing skills related to information gathering, vulnerability analysis, exploitation, post-exploitation, and reporting.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
86 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
