/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
87 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 52 0 R
/E (The exam is designed for experienced penetration testers and cybersecurity professionals looking to advance their skills and get certified at a higher level of expertise. Achieving the OSCP+ certification not only demonstrates hands-on technical capabilities but also prepares individuals for various security roles such as penetration testers, red team members, or security consultants. The certification is recognized in the cybersecurity industry and can significantly enhance career prospects by showcasing advanced technical skills in ethical hacking.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
